  "contract": "Requires ClassicPlus.CombatRules=1 (default) and CoA.ItemScaling.Native.RebornArmor=1 with ItemAddon.dbc. Vanilla 1.12 mitigates armor / (armor + 85 x attackerLevel + 400) up to creature level 63, so a level 60 creature's blow keeps 5500 / (armor + 5500) and a level 63 creature's 5755 / (armor + 5755). The level 60 Reaper victim strips its starter gear (252 armor from 126 Agility), then wears Titanic Breastplate, Dark Iron Leggings and Helm of Domination (reborn armor 982 + 865 + 909). The attackers are two Hevram Bristol 1288 spawns at levels 60 and 63; neither has armor penetration.",
